WEBVTT

00:05:28.074 --> 00:05:30.368
from where the last bus
could drop him off.

00:05:31.452 --> 00:05:34.121
So here we are, walking to the center.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.831
It's very cold.

00:05:36.499 --> 00:05:38.417
And during this walk,

00:05:38.459 --> 00:05:40.920
Jimmy does his best
to make me feel comfortable.

00:05:41.921 --> 00:05:44.590
He tells me no fewer than five times,

00:05:44.632 --> 00:05:47.635
"Man, I appreciate spending time
with a brother like you."

00:05:47.635 --> 00:05:48.928
This is what he says.

00:05:49.387 --> 00:05:52.264
He says, "I'm glad
to be doing something positive."

00:05:52.306 --> 00:05:53.808
This is what he tells me.

00:05:54.558 --> 00:05:57.603
And he begins to compliment me
until I feel uncomfortable.

00:05:57.645 --> 00:06:00.022
I think he’s trying
to butter me up for something;